From: Shigeaki Asai <y-asai.0816@docomonet.jp>
Subject: [PATCH] add rgb10-max-3-pro as a link to odroid-go-ultra

The Powkiddy RGB10 Max 3 Pro uses the same boot firmware as the
ODROID-GO Ultra.

This was made with the help of Claude (an AI assistant).
---
diff --git a/rgb10-max-3-pro b/rgb10-max-3-pro
new file mode 120000
--- /dev/null
+++ b/rgb10-max-3-pro
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+odroid-go-ultra
\ No newline at end of file
